    <help sid="HelpAutomobileIdentificationCard_RemarkText_F">
      <value>Enter text: The remarks associated with the Auto ID Card.  Certain states require special provisions to be added to the Auto ID card exactly below the form title.  Use this space for any additional required text in these states. </value>
